Hi,

I would like to announce my candidacy for Octavia PTL for the 2027.1 release
cycle.
I have been PTL since the Hibiscus cycle and between the Xena and Epoxy
releases, and I want to continue the team's efforts on the Octavia project.

My plan as PTL for 2027.1 is to:

* Continue to improve CI stability and job performance.
* Review and land outstanding patches, including tests for recent features in
  octavia-tempest-plugin.
* Help new contributors get involved in the project.

Thanks for your consideration,

Gregory Thiemonge (gthiemonge)
